			"versionNonce": 2076004969,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783505212668,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Fixed Size Limitations (Static Arrays): If you allocate an array for 100 items but get\n101, your program crashes. If you get 5 items, you have wasted 95 slots of memory.The\nShift Penalty (O(n)): Inserting or deleting an element from the middle of the array is\nexceptionally slow. Because you cannot leave gaps in contiguous memory, every element\nafter the target must be manually shifted one-by-one.",
			"rawText": "Fixed Size Limitations (Static Arrays): If you allocate an array for 100 items but get 101, your program crashes. If you get 5 items, you have wasted 95 slots of memory.The Shift Penalty (O(n)): Inserting or deleting an element from the middle of the array is exceptionally slow. Because you cannot leave gaps in contiguous memory, every element after the target must be manually shifted one-by-one.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "dNOugJ9eJpNucQfDBD4V-",
			"originalText": "Fixed Size Limitations (Static Arrays): If you allocate an array for 100 items but get 101, your program crashes. If you get 5 items, you have wasted 95 slots of memory.The Shift Penalty (O(n)): Inserting or deleting an element from the middle of the array is exceptionally slow. Because you cannot leave gaps in contiguous memory, every element after the target must be manually shifted one-by-one.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
