			"seed": 1207234052,
			"version": 430,
			"versionNonce": 710386364,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783511919123,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Because ArrayList<T> uses Java Generics (<T>), it cannot process raw physical primitives. \nYou must use Wrapper Classes. \nJava performs \"Auto-boxing\" (converting primitive to wrapper) and \"Unboxing\" (wrapper to primitive)\nautomatically, but this carries a hidden performance cost.",
			"rawText": "Because ArrayList<T> uses Java Generics (<T>), it cannot process raw physical primitives. \nYou must use Wrapper Classes. \nJava performs \"Auto-boxing\" (converting primitive to wrapper) and \"Unboxing\" (wrapper to primitive) automatically, but this carries a hidden performance cost.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Because ArrayList<T> uses Java Generics (<T>), it cannot process raw physical primitives. \nYou must use Wrapper Classes. \nJava performs \"Auto-boxing\" (converting primitive to wrapper) and \"Unboxing\" (wrapper to primitive) automatically, but this carries a hidden performance cost.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
